54611168e4b0ba83040c5ac3.body:
Abstract (from&nbsp;http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/jawr.12179/abstract):&nbsp; 
Freshwater mussels (order Unionida) are a highly imperiled group of organisms that are at risk from rising stream temperatures ( 
T 
